        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Eden neila mei zion",
            "Ting puan zing makpui ram,",
            "Nzianna nkhuanc neh Poubaomei tyngmik;",
            "Ravguangc latzan nam dai khou",
            "Bw-neih gaanhmei nai dat lak khe’",
            "Lauziuna riu tei rui",
            "Tingsaeng gan bam puni",
            "",
            "2. Chui mak mei na maan mei pri tei rui;",
            "Paap phung mei ata ncham louna,",
            "Alung laina guang nge",
            "Aravguangc lalou o.",
            "",
            "3. Apu ram nzian thaimak khou rui",
            "Kandih ramgai khou ai maeng du the",
            "Ai rianc rana apu",
            "Ta ning tou na kap be.",
            "",
            "4. Tingzin kei nruai guai rabam the;",
            "Ai ni akai tingkao zuan ni the,",
            "Ai amaan saeng lak khe",
            "Akai zuan kan ni the."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
